  "notes": "Boot a Corvette ROM from an empty NVRAM with the coin door open (public 22 released); the scenario names no game. Leave the fresh-NVRAM FACTORY SETTINGS RESTORED loop with Escape (5), press Enter twice (game identification, then MAIN MENU), Up twice to T. TESTS and Enter to open the test menu at T.1 SWITCH EDGES. Run it with PinMAME's built-in mechanisms enabled (--handle-mechanics 7). Open T.5 FLASHER TEST, which starts in REPEAT mode on the first flasher, then press Up 10 times, taking six frames 0.25 s apart after each press so the blinking name is caught lit, and record the flasher the ROM names and the public output it pulses.",
